WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
He scanned a customer's lottery ticket,

00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:05.800
saw it had won a million dollars, and

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.960
said, "Sorry, man, not a winner." The

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.880
guy just shrugs, says, "Story of my

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:12.159
life," and walks out. The second the

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.760
door closes, the cashier is elbow-deep

00:00:12.159 --> 00:00:15.600
in the trash can, fishing the ticket

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.239
back out and tucking it into his wallet

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.239
like it's been his all along. By

00:00:17.239 --> 00:00:21.520
midnight, he's already bought a boat, a

00:00:19.239 --> 00:00:23.239
mansion, and a whole new set of friends,

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.000
at least in his head. So, the next

00:00:23.239 --> 00:00:26.840
morning, he drives 2 hours to the

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.440
lottery office, slides the ticket under

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.319
the glass, and the lady at the counter

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:33.680
smiles and says, "Wow, congratulations!

00:00:31.319 --> 00:00:36.240
Just wait right here." So, he waits. 5

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:38.279
minutes go by, then 10, until finally a

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:40.119
door opens behind him. In walks the guy

00:00:38.279 --> 00:00:41.799
from the store, except now he's wearing

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:43.720
a suit with a badge on his belt,

00:00:41.799 --> 00:00:45.680
followed by two police officers. You

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:47.560
see, in real life, lotteries noticed

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:49.080
that store clerks were winning way more

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:51.560
often than everyone else, which is

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:53.240
statistically a little suspicious. So,

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:55.279
they started printing winning tickets as

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:56.959
bait and sending undercover agents into

00:00:55.279 --> 00:00:59.720
stores pretending to be regular

00:00:56.959 --> 00:00:59.720
customers.

